WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.586 --> 00:00:16.675
"Get Teplo croaked hoarsely.

2
00:00:17.456 --> 00:00:21.299
Zann and Perda rubbed their hands together as Teplo let out several loud grunts.

3
00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:24.021
"Shift," Perda whispered.

4
00:00:24.742 --> 00:00:29.906
Zann focused on sending Teplo's grunts away so that they seemed to be coming from the guard troll.

5
00:00:31.387 --> 00:00:32.308
The other trolls heard.

6
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.542
They turned to look at the guard and noticed the turnip prisoners.

7
00:00:35.562 --> 00:00:37.384
"It's working!"

8
00:00:37.764 --> 00:00:38.345
Darb whispered.

9
00:00:38.365 --> 00:00:40.606
"They think all their prisoners just escaped!"

10
00:00:41.347 --> 00:00:46.491
The turnip prisoners were still running, luring the trolls away from the pen.

11
00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:47.832
"Go!" Teplo gasped.

12
00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:52.776
"Hurry! I'm not sure how much longer I can hold all the illusions steady."

13
00:00:53.597 --> 00:00:55.679
Zann and the others rushed out of their hiding place.

14
00:00:55.699 --> 00:00:59.061
"I'll blast the lock," Fala said.

15
00:00:59.081 --> 00:01:01.924
"Get ready to help everyone to the exit."

16
00:01:02.784 --> 00:01:04.465
The prisoners had seen what was happening.

17
00:01:06.746 --> 00:01:09.287
As soon as Fala opened the door, they started running out.

18
00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:13.148
Zann and his friends helped them all find the exit through the hedge.

19
00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:16.750
Even Zing helped by hovering over the spot and whistling.

20
00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:21.291
"Gliss!" Perda cried, rushing to grab her friend's hand when she emerged.

21
00:01:21.311 --> 00:01:22.252
"This way!

22
00:01:22.552 --> 00:01:25.473
Hurry!" Zann started to follow the girls.

23
00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:28.774
Then he heard a weak voice crying out somewhere behind him.

24
00:01:28.794 --> 00:01:32.176
"Help! Please wait for me.

25
00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:33.500
Oh dear!"

26
00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:35.761
It was the elderly woman.

27
00:01:36.081 --> 00:01:39.662
She was following a stray turnip prisoner that was running toward the trolls.

28
00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:41.243
"Oh no!"

29
00:01:41.743 --> 00:01:42.383
Zann murmured.

30
00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:44.263
He raced after the woman.

31
00:01:44.984 --> 00:01:47.344
She was already much too close to the trolls.

32
00:01:48.044 --> 00:01:50.665
If he didn't stop her, she'd be recaptured for sure.

33
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:54.006
And everyone knew that trolls had a bad temper.

34
00:01:54.826 --> 00:01:56.347
Who knew what they'd do to punish her?

35
00:01:57.187 --> 00:01:58.908
"Stop!" Zann grabbed her arm.

36
00:01:59.288 --> 00:02:00.028
"Come this way!"

37
00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.621
The woman stopped, looking confused.

38
00:02:03.261 --> 00:02:06.683
At the same moment, Zann saw one of the trolls turn and spot them.

39
00:02:07.343 --> 00:02:09.024
Grunting, it lumbered toward them.

40
00:02:09.804 --> 00:02:10.625
Zann froze.

41
00:02:10.945 --> 00:02:16.467
The troll was changing as he watched it, its dull eyes growing brighter and its hands sparking with

42
00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:20.549
energy. "Uh-oh," thought Zann, guessing what that meant.

43
00:02:21.229 --> 00:02:25.031
Maybe the trolls hadn't been getting any extra energy from Morb for the past day or two.

44
00:02:25.371 --> 00:02:26.392
But they were getting it now.

45
00:02:27.168 --> 00:02:31.832
When he glanced at the rest of the trolls, who were starting to turn toward him, Zann saw

46
00:02:31.892 --> 00:02:34.615
that they were all charged with magical energy.

47
00:02:34.635 --> 00:02:36.396
"They're coming!"

48
00:02:36.797 --> 00:02:37.798
the old woman exclaimed.

49
00:02:37.818 --> 00:02:39.059
"Oh dear!"

50
00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.361
Zann didn't respond.

51
00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:44.563
He didn't have the heart to tell her that they were doomed.

52
00:02:45.284 --> 00:02:47.346
His friends were too far away to help.

53
00:02:47.706 --> 00:02:49.848
Even Zing couldn't possibly get to them in time.

54
00:02:50.629 --> 00:02:51.610
"Run, young man!

55
00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.952
Hurry!" The woman gave him a light shove.

56
00:02:54.668 --> 00:02:57.650
"You might be able to get away if they grab me first."

57
00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.673
Zann doubted that was true—the trolls were moving fast, thanks to their new infusion of magical energy.

58
00:03:04.474 --> 00:03:07.055
Even if it was true though, he couldn't abandon her.

59
00:03:07.075 --> 00:03:09.496
"It's okay," he said.

60
00:03:09.516 --> 00:03:11.437
"We'll figure something out together."

61
00:03:12.278 --> 00:03:13.419
But he knew it was hopeless.

62
00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:15.480
There was no escape this time.

63
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.222
"Zann!" Teplo shouted, emerging from his hiding place.

64
00:03:19.242 --> 00:03:21.583
"Go!" Zann shouted.

65
00:03:21.603 --> 00:03:22.724
"Get out of here!"

66
00:03:23.488 --> 00:03:24.829
But Teplo hurried toward him.

67
00:03:25.789 --> 00:03:29.391
As he did, he yanked off his hat, revealing his wild red hair.

68
00:03:29.411 --> 00:03:32.792
"Yoo-hoo!" Teplo called out.

69
00:03:33.152 --> 00:03:34.953
"Look here, you dumb trolls!

70
00:03:35.773 --> 00:03:37.574
I've got a troll snack for you!"

71
00:03:38.354 --> 00:03:42.196
He snapped his fingers, conjuring up a giant blob of glowberry pudding.

72
00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:44.457
The trolls stopped and stared.

73
00:03:44.837 --> 00:03:46.398
A few started drooling immediately.

74
00:03:46.418 --> 00:03:49.259
"Yum!" Teplo exclaimed.

75
00:03:50.079 --> 00:03:55.149
He made a loud chewing sound as the illusion wavered and then quickly faded away.

76
00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.090
The trolls looked confused and annoyed.

77
00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:01.492
With howls of outrage, they all raced toward Teplo.

78
00:04:02.272 --> 00:04:07.554
He let out a whoop and ran away, heading deeper into the zoo, his bare ankles flashing beneath

79
00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:08.554
his too-short robe.

80
00:04:09.495 --> 00:04:12.976
Zann remained frozen, not understanding for a moment what was happening.

81
00:04:13.637 --> 00:04:14.637
Was Teplo crazy?

82
00:04:14.997 --> 00:04:16.978
He'd never be able to outrun the trolls!

83
00:04:17.858 --> 00:04:22.080
After expending all that energy, he probably couldn't even zap himself either!

84
00:04:23.232 --> 00:04:25.654
Then Teplo glanced back over his shoulder.

85
00:04:25.674 --> 00:04:28.535
"Go!" he shouted at Zann.

86
00:04:28.555 --> 00:04:31.377
"I'll say hi to your grandfather for you!"

87
00:04:32.197 --> 00:04:36.119
Zann realized that the old man was sacrificing his own freedom for Zann's.

88
00:04:36.139 --> 00:04:38.521
"No!" he cried.

89
00:04:39.161 --> 00:04:41.422
But it was too late to change what Teplo had done.

90
00:04:42.123 --> 00:04:44.624
Zann only hoped he could live up to Teplo's faith in him.

91
00:04:45.704 --> 00:04:50.727
"I think the trolls are distracted enough not to notice this," he said, grabbing the old woman's hand.

92
00:04:52.716 --> 00:04:54.577
"Zap!" They landed just outside the zoo.

93
00:04:55.277 --> 00:04:58.438
Others were still pouring through the hedge and running off in all directions.

94
00:04:59.359 --> 00:05:02.380
A young man let out a cry of relief and grabbed the old woman.

95
00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.422
Then Zann spotted Gliss and his other friends ahead in the crowd.

96
00:05:07.162 --> 00:05:10.303
Thrilled to see that Gliss was free, Zann sprinted after them.

97
00:05:11.964 --> 00:05:15.045
Half an hour later, Zann finally had a chance to catch his breath.

98
00:05:15.785 --> 00:05:18.967
He and his friends were in an abandoned building a few blocks from the zoo.

99
00:05:18.987 --> 00:05:22.128
"This location should be safe," Fala said.

100
00:05:22.856 --> 00:05:25.898
"It's listed as vacant on all the official city records.

101
00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:29.361
Plus it has an old Shield spell still covering it."

102
00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:31.762
"Does that mean Morb can't find us here?"

103
00:05:32.043 --> 00:05:32.683
Darb asked.

104
00:05:33.784 --> 00:05:35.505
"I hope so," Fala replied.

105
00:05:35.525 --> 00:05:39.207
"Still, I'd better check the area for any sign of trolls.

106
00:05:40.108 --> 00:05:42.370
Don't use any magic while I'm gone."

107
00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.771
She hurried out, leaving the kids alone.

108
00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:47.033
"Wow!" Perda said.

109
00:05:47.053 --> 00:05:48.574
"That was crazy.

110
00:05:49.254 --> 00:05:51.156
What was it like being a prisoner, Gliss?"

111
00:05:51.944 --> 00:05:53.845
Gliss hadn't said much since being rescued.

112
00:05:54.805 --> 00:05:57.406
Now Zann noticed she looked distracted and agitated.

113
00:05:57.426 --> 00:05:59.247
"Are you okay?"

114
00:05:59.647 --> 00:06:00.307
Zann asked her.

115
00:06:00.327 --> 00:06:05.469
"Listen, I'm really sorry I—" Gliss didn't let him finish.

116
00:06:06.309 --> 00:06:07.570
"No, I'm not okay!"

117
00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.370
she exclaimed in a shaky voice.

118
00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:14.212
"You guys won't be either once you hear what I found out while I was a prisoner!"
